  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EASTERN ISLANDS SMALLHOLDERS FARMING LIVESTOCK DEVELOP.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN OBJECTIVE OF THIS PROJ TO INCREASE THE INCOME LEVEL OF THE RELATIVELY POOR RURAL HOUSEHOLDS IN 9 DISTRICTS WHICH ARE LOCATED IN 3 EASTERN PROVINCES OF INDONESIA BY PROVIDING THE NECESSARY INFRASTRUCTURE ALONG WITH INITIAL DSITRIBUTION OF 41.800 CATTLE AND 20.000 GOATS THROUGH CREDIT _IN_KIND ARRANGEMENT AND OTHER NECESSARY INPUTS.</narrative>
  </description>
